Error [E0003]: `defer` only schedules a consuming resource close
  --> tests/ui/defer_only_close.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     defer print("not a resource close")
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Jet has no general deferred-action mechanism; resource cleanup stays explicit and ownership-checked through the move-capability marker `^`
 Fix: write `defer close(^resource)` with the move-capability marker `^`
